{
  "_comment": "One grammar: the sidecar's actions parser reads these lines the same way (units metric unless stated); since v1.2 the trainer chat is the one box (Ctrl+K opens it), so there is no second parser in the app. kind null = not an action. log_count and log_food_grams are natural lines (\"10 pushups\", \"chicken breast 200g\") that the sidecar resolves by looking the name up, into log_set or log_meal. `actions` is the one allowlist: the only data-changing actions the trainer chat and the local AI may propose (the sidecar's actions registry runs exactly these, each after a confirm). `chat_ui` lists what a trainer reply may ask the UI to do (open a page, a tour, the planner, the picker, an action card, a share card); none of them changes data.",
